  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3867233f-a41d-499c-8cca-ae05ac6c4d0e.png\"></p><p>簡易附魔提取是一個貼近原版的模組，只需使用鐵砧就能從裝備中提取附魔——無需任何新方塊或物品！</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_557b70ef-27bd-4675-8841-79bcefd50325.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=0843bf&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Txni&amp;labelColor=36633c&amp;color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/EasyDisenchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Github&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=666666&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=fb594a&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=CurseForge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=33de61&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_891ba103-aea9-4258-8301-afcc9a6981b6.png\"></p><p>這個模組是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-transfer\" rel=\"nofollow\">附魔轉移</a>的重寫版本，更新至新的Minecraft版本，並進行了關鍵的錯誤修復與改進，包括能夠轉移附魔並將其合併到已附魔的書上。</p><p>使用方法非常簡單：只需將一把劍與一本空白書放入鐵砧中，就能從物品上提取附魔：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_56a541ac-81fa-4866-98ec-7f830c4407d1.png\"></p><p>如果你想將附魔提取到一本已附魔的書上，應該將書放在第一個欄位。這會以合併兩本附魔書的方式來組合與合併附魔。</p><p>預設情況下，簡易附魔提取的消耗與原版合併附魔相同，並且會將被提取附魔的物品歸還給你。你可以在設定檔中更改這兩個設定以進行平衡調整。</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
